WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.837
The same bank in two different sentences

00:00:30.837 --> 00:01:03.772
From a stored word vector to a contextual one

00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:40.157
Other tokens can change this representation

00:01:40.157 --> 00:02:19.283
Model tokens are not index terms

00:02:19.283 --> 00:02:57.394
Many token vectors. One complete-text vector.

00:02:57.394 --> 00:03:34.866
Reproducible does not mean easy to interpret

00:03:34.866 --> 00:04:11.833
Context is a capability, not a relevance verdict
